url: "https://github.com/AliTavakkoli80/sdn-mtd-mbb-rl"
abstract: >-
  A stateful, zero-downtime Moving Target Defense (MTD) framework for
  Software-Defined Networks (SDN). Implements an OpenFlow 1.3 Make-Before-Break
  (MBB) dual-table pipeline (Table 0 Active and Table 1 Grace) integrated with
  an information-theoretic L2/L3/L4 threat detector and an 8-dimensional
  Multi-Objective Markov Decision Process (MOMDP) solved via Proximal Policy
  Optimization (PPO) with Sim-to-Real fine-tuning on a 16-host 2-Spine 4-Leaf
  Containernet testbed.
keywords:
  - "Software-Defined Networking"
